    "media:imagetext": "MAC flying I\nto VIET NANTAn\n20-29,70\nCapt Kelly Owen\nF/O\nJim Chaffee\nF/E\nDon\nBolding\nA.\nMarge O'Connor SFO (Res)\nCarol Murray Wypich LAX\nJane Wiesmiller\nLAX\nBernadette Funk\nSFO\nE. Me\nDrank much. I alone must have\nconsumed 4 bottles of gin. First\nlayover in HNL spent in Maui with\nF/0 and the 4 other stwds. (Iwo\npictures, in scrapbook. One shows\nJane and me stealing pineapples\non Maul. It wouldn't have happen-\ned if we hed known pineapples\ngrew above ground. Weedidn't\nfind any.)\nSecond layover in\nDA sent\ndeep see fishing with Kelly, Jim\nand the 5 of us stews. Caught two\n20 pd. tuna. Gave one of them to\nthe hotel st ff in exchange for\npreparing the other for our dinner.\nYummy. First time for raw fish.\nIt is scrumpcious-- soft and ten-\nder. We would have had tires, but\nI blew it-- had one on and lost it.\nBut 2 was quite sufficient even if\nKelly was upset. We bought champagn\nfor the crew, although they could\nnot drink it that night as they had\na trip in-country. (We were being\nsplit up, due to a mechanical that",
